.wrangler/

# Paused, in-progress projects — removed from the repo until they are finished.
# Kept on disk locally, and also excluded in pnpm-workspace.yaml: without that
# exclusion they still match `apps/*` / `tooling/*` on a maintainer machine, so
# `pnpm install` would re-add their importers to pnpm-lock.yaml and a fresh
# clone (which has no such directories) would then fail CI's --frozen-lockfile.
# Full trees: `git checkout archive/paused-projects-2026-08-03 -- <path>`.
/apps/token-manager/
/tooling/figma-code-connect-plugin/
/tooling/figma-component-bridge/
